@startuml testing_overview
!theme plain
title Testing Strategy - Rust Application

package "Unit Tests" {
    [Database Tests] as DBTests
    [API Tests] as APITests
    [HTTP Tests] as HTTPTests
}

package "Integration Tests" {
    [Database Integration] as DBIntegration
    [API Integration] as APIIntegration
}

package "Test Framework" {
    [Cargo Test] as CargoTest
    [rocket::local::blocking::Client] as RocketClient
    [tokio_postgres::Client] as PostgresClient
}

package "Test Data" {
    [conf/pgbo_sql.toml] as TestConfig
}

' Relations
CargoTest --> DBTests
CargoTest --> APITests  
CargoTest --> HTTPTests
CargoTest --> DBIntegration
CargoTest --> APIIntegration

DBTests --> PostgresClient
APITests --> RocketClient
HTTPTests --> RocketClient
DBIntegration --> PostgresClient
APIIntegration --> RocketClient

DBTests --> TestConfig
APITests --> TestConfig
DBIntegration --> TestConfig

note right of DBTests : Database Tests:\\n* test_create_client_connection()\\n* test_create_client_strict()\\n* test_db_connectivity()

note right of APITests : API Tests:\\n* test_person_data_endpoints()\\n* test_person_data_by_id_endpoint()\\n* test_person_data_by_id_not_found()

note right of HTTPTests : HTTP Tests:\\n* test_ping_endpoint()\\n* test_index_endpoint()\\n* test_db_connectivity_endpoint()

note right of DBIntegration : Database Integration:\\n* Real PostgreSQL connection\\n* Table creation validation\\n* Data insertion/retrieval

note right of APIIntegration : API Integration:\\n* End-to-end API testing\\n* JSON response validation\\n* Error handling verification

note right of TestConfig : Test Configuration:\\n* SQL queries\\n* Test data\\n* Table schemas

@enduml
